    "notes": "Fresh 1x capture site7_rifle_se_live_1789295557914.webm and sequential native crops observed. At 0.538 to 0.638 seconds frame2-to3 changes the connected silver/red kneecap plus small lower plate into different large geometry and a red shin stripe; frame4 at 0.838 to 0.938 has a single long plain shin panel and lacks the articulated small lower kneecap plate. At 1.038 seconds frame5 restores the reference knee design. Two leg chains now read, and thick foreshortened upper/gun projection improved, but costume flicker is unresolved at 2-to3 and 4-to5. Replace only SE3/SE4 using exact knee/shin detail authority, retain other sources and tempo; no app promotion.",
