    "notes": "Third fresh kit 76a29e3ec249e919_2fa834b1 and actual1x canvas video site7_rifle_se_live_1789297815265.webm were observed through native pairs and sequential native decode. The repaired segmented kneecaps now remain consistent, and the left/right support halves exchange with two connected boots. One conspicuous source costume discrepancy remains in frame3 at0.640/0.769s (again1.838/1.961s): a long bright red stripe appears on the foreground right THIGH plate below the holster, absent in other phases. This is separate from the correct red knee cap. Repair only that thigh paint in current clear-pose frame3, preserving leg silhouette and the now-correct compact knee/shin construction. Keep frames0/1/2/4/5 and tempo unchanged. No cycle approval or app promotion yet.",
